<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak July real ind. output up 5.5 pct yr/yr - SUSR.</title>
<headline>Slovak July real ind. output up 5.5 pct yr/yr - SUSR.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak real industrial production rose 5.5 percent year-on-year in July, compared with a 1.8 percent decline in June, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
